<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS2" title="In Appendix E Posterior contraction and adaptation ‣ Provable test-time adaptivity and distributional robustness of in-context learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.2 </span>Bayesian nonparametric regression</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Provable test-time adaptivity and distributional robustness of in-context learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Proofs for Section <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a>
